  "hero_summary_zh": "时间就是虚空假面的一切。时间经他加速可以缩短两地之间的行程，由他篡改可以消弭伤害，他还可以强行停下一片区域内的时间，毁灭他的敌人。只要给他充足的时间，他就能迎来自己的辉煌时代。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Time is everything to Faceless Void. He speeds time to dash between locations, manipulates it to dodge attacks, stops it in a large area to devastate his foes, and given enough of it to gather resources, he can make himself unbelievably powerful.",
